      "id": "hub",
      "text": "I keep a list of names this town can count on when the horn goes. Short list. You're about to be on it. Two stops first: Rowan's book, Ansel's pillar. Beginning and cost. Then me.",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "kind": "quest_offer",
          "quest": "the_ford_holds"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll stand the watch.",
          "next": "sworn"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lists make me nervous.",
          "next": "declined"
        }
      ],
      "voice": "q_the_ford_holds_offer__hub"
    },
    {
      "id": "sworn",
      "text": "Dusk is best. The town shows you what it is at dusk. That's not sentiment, that's when trouble comes.",
      "hooks": [
        {
          "kind": "quest_accept",
          "quest": "the_ford_holds"
        }
      ],
      "voice": "q_the_ford_holds_offer__sworn"
    },
    {
      "id": "declined",
      "text": "Good instinct. Stay off the other lists and this one won't hurt you.",
      "voice": "q_the_ford_holds_offer__declined"
    }
  ]
}
